msgstr "Tampilkan tombol OneTimeSecret"

#: inc/secret.class.php:245
msgid "Hi,"
msgstr "Hai,"

#: inc/secret.class.php:246
msgid ""
"As mentioned in our previous conversation, this message is meant to share "
"sensitive information with you."
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang disebutkan dalam percakapan kita sebelumnya, pesan ini "
"dimaksudkan untuk berbagi informasi sensitif dengan Anda."

#: inc/secret.class.php:247
msgid ""
"A secret link <b>only works once</b> and <b>then disappears forever</b>. Do "
"not open it if you are not the intended recipient."
msgstr ""
"Tautan rahasia <b>hanya berfungsi sekali</b> dan <b>kemudian menghilang "
"selamanya</b> . Jangan membukanya jika Anda bukan penerima yang dimaksud."

#: inc/secret.class.php:248
msgid "Here you have"
msgstr "Di sini Anda memiliki"

#: inc/secret.class.php:249
msgid "your secret link"
msgstr "tautan rahasia Anda"

#: inc/secret.class.php:252
msgid ""
"I will send you the required passphrase to open it using an alternative "
"method for security reasons."
msgstr ""
"Saya akan mengirimi Anda frasa sandi yang diperlukan untuk membukanya dengan "
"menggunakan metode alternatif demi alasan keamanan."

#: inc/secret.class.php:254
msgid "Bear in mind:"
msgstr "Ingatlah:"

#: inc/secret.class.php:254
msgid "A secret link can only be opened once and will expire afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Tautan rahasia hanya bisa dibuka satu kali dan akan kedaluwarsa setelahnya."

#: inc/secret.class.php:255
#, php-format
msgid "This secret link will expire %1$s after its generation."
msgstr "Tautan rahasia ini akan kedaluwarsa %1$s setelah generasinya."

#: inc/secret.class.php:256
msgid "Regards,"
msgstr "Salam,"

